          ],
          "summary": "Lockwood reflects on his own awkwardness, then gets into trouble with the dogs. Heathcliff, Joseph, and a kitchen servant intervene, and Heathcliff ends by offering wine and a grudging civility before Lockwood departs interested enough to return.",
